#trigger !help
#name Help Command
#type prefix
#description Shows a help message with a list of all commands and their descriptions.

Zreply{}
Zdescription{# Help for ZBR Support Bot
Here is the list of every single command in this bot:
!help - Shows this message
!find <function_name> - Search for an exact ZBR function by name and return full details including syntax, description, arguments, and an example. Case-insensitive.
!search <query> - Search for ZBR functions by a query and return a list of matching functions with their descriptions. Case-insensitive.
!random - Get a random ZBR function with its details including syntax, description, arguments, and an example.
!triggers - List all command triggers available in this bot.
!category <category_name> - List all ZBR functions in a specific category with their descriptions. Case-insensitive.
}